            "text": "Only part of the range. Herbalife says Herbalife24 Formula 1 Sport, Rebuild Strength and Enhanced Protein Powder are NSF Certified for Sport, and NSF's database lists them. We found no independent certification for the regular Formula 1 shake, Protein Drink Mix or Personalized Protein Powder, whose US pages mention no NSF, Informed Sport or similar seal. Herbalife describes in-house quality testing for those products."
